    "text": "St James\nPedestrian hit by car in St. James\nBy Press Release,\n4 hours agoSuffolk County Police Fourth Squad detectives are investigating a motor vehicle crash that seriously injured a pedestrian in Saint James on Aug. 6. Harold Day was walking northbound on Lake Avenue at the intersection of Railroad Avenue when he was struck by a 2010 Dodge Ram that was traveling southbound on Lake Avenue and attempting to turn onto the eastbound lanes of Railroad Avenue at approximately 9 a.m.",
